## Featured Essays

&nbsp;

- &nbsp; <span class="badge bg-success">New</span> [Markdown Is Not $$\LaTeX$$](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/markdown-is-not-latex) &mdash; important technical discussion on how inline math tokens have been incorporated into :fa-github: GitHub Flavored Markdown (GFM).

- [Wikis in Knowledge Management Systems](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/wikis) &mdash; a primer on how Orion fits into the Big Picture of 2026.

- &nbsp; [Application Performance](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/performance) &mdash; a working example: from an observable bottleneck to an effective resolution.

- &nbsp; [Information Security](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/infosec) &mdash; abstraction of the basic concepts leads to wide real-world applicability and clarity.

- &nbsp; [Sealed Lexicals for Perl 7](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/perl7-sealed-lexicals) &mdash; add <span class="text-info">:sealed</span> to a function definition and enjoy the extra speed of compile-time method lookups for all of its typed lexicals.

- &nbsp; [The DevOps Movement](https://iconoclasts.blog/joe/devops) &mdash; filled in the missing details on this article.

